# Sales Performance Dashboard — Power BI

Multi-page Power BI dashboard analyzing sales performance across 
European markets. Covers KPI tracking, profit margin analysis by 
category, geographical distribution and year-over-year trend analysis.
Built during professional training — IOA Sri Lanka Chapter.

## Dashboard Pages
- Page 1: KPI Overview — Lead Time, Total Sales, Total Profit, Total Cost
- Page 2: Geographical Distribution
- Page 3: Product Details
- Tooltip and additional pages

